# Playwright E2E

- All Playwright config/tests live under **`e2e/`** — never mix with `src/`.
- When changing shell, Structure, Links, editor, or landing UX/UI, **run Playwright** (`bun run test:e2e`, `:headed`, or `:ui`) and inspect the real browser, not only code.
- Prefer walking Structure (brand home) ↔ Note ↔ Links ↔ Files and capturing/updating screenshots in `e2e/design.spec.ts` when visuals change.
- Docs: `.cortext/e2e.md`, `e2e/README.md`.
